    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81311" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιέλκ-ω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιείλκῠσα</span>, later <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
