					Philostr.
					<u>Her.</u>
					19.8
				</span></i>
			 :—<i>drag round, drag about</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				7.6.10
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τινὰ ὡς ἀνδράποδον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1145b24
